## Code-review follow-ups for v0.7.0

Context: Post-review cleanup on `develop` (v0.6.3 → 0.7.0). Extract fat node
context/action routes into a domain service, migrate remaining `success: False`
envelopes to `OntoBricksError`, wire `bridge_depth`, bound PGE session extras,
add missing UI contract tests, and close docs gaps.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/NodeContextService.py
   Extract Class for node context resolution and UC action invocation; raise
   ValidationError / NotFoundError / InfrastructureError on hard failures
   (complies with `.cursor/05` / `src/.coding_rules.md §1` + §4).
2. src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py
   Thin `dt_nodes_context` / `dt_nodes_action` routes; wire `bridge_depth`
   through to BFS (le=5); re-export `_RDF_TYPE` for tests.
3. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/__init__.py
   Re-export `NodeContextService`.
4. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/DigitalTwin.py
   `interpret_graph_metrics` raises `InfrastructureError` instead of returning
   `{"success": False, ...}`.
5. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Registry check / Lakebase permission / grant helpers raise OntoBricksError
   subclasses instead of success envelopes.
6. src/front/templates/partials/registry/_registry_configuration.html
   Repair-permissions UI handles HTTP ErrorResponse (`message`) from grants.
7. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   Cap `assignment.mapping_run_log` at 500 newest entries across PGE runs.
8. src/mcp-server/server/app.py
   `invoke_entity_action` surfaces HTTP 4xx/5xx OntoBricksError messages.
9. src/front/routes/home.py
   Remove unused logger / session_mgr imports from settings route.
10. docs/features.md
    Document Unmap all, graph readiness indicator, registry navbar modal,
    CamelCase domain names.
11. docs/sphinx/api/app.objects.digitaltwin.rst
    Automodule entry for `NodeContextService`.
12. tests/units/api/test_node_context_endpoint.py
    Patch service helpers; assert `bridge_depth` is passed to BFS.
13. tests/units/api/test_node_action_endpoint.py
    Expect OntoBricksError HTTP status codes (400/404/502).
14. tests/units/front/test_unmap_all_ui.py
    Contract tests for Unmap all buttons, confirm copy, failure restore.
15. tests/units/front/test_kg_readiness_indicator.py
    Contract tests for readiness badge states and backend labels.
16. tests/units/mapping/test_pge_session_extras_retention.py
